    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d240-a4">

                <pb facs="0353" n="247" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg247"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure C.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The intendente of
                            Valparaiso to Capt. Schley</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Republic of Chile, Intendencia of Valparaiso</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1891-11-18"><hi rendition="#italic">November
                                18, 1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The judge of the criminal court, in an official letter of this date, informs me
                    as follows:</p>
                <p>“At this moment I have received your note of yesterday, and in replying to it
                    permit me to say that this tribunal will put into execution the pending
                    confrontation of witnesses between the sailors of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Baltimore</hi> and the culprits in the cause, the 20th of the present
                    month, from 3 to 4 p.m.</p>
                <p>“Do me the kindness to transmit the present communication to the captain of the
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Baltimore”</hi></p>
                <p>Which I have the honor to bring to your knowledge for the purpose in view.</p>
                <p>God guard you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. de D. Arlegui</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
